#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:2
msgid "Proxies"
msgstr "Proxies"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:8
msgid ""
"In many situations,companies deploy virtual machines in proxy restricted "
"environments for things such as PCI Compliance, or just general security. As"
" a result of this |morpheus| provides out of the box support for proxy "
"connectivity. Proxy authentication support is also provided with both Basic "
"Authentication capabilities as well as NTLM for Windows Proxy environments. "
"|morpheus| is even able to configure virtual machines it provisions to "
"utilize these proxies by setting up the operating systems proxy settings "
"directly (restricted to cloud-init based Linux platforms for now, but can "
"also be done on windows based platforms in a different manner)."
msgstr ""
"En muchos situations,companies deploy virtual machines en proxy restricted "
"entornos para things como PCI Compliance, o solo general security. Como un "
"resultado de este |morpheus| proporciona de forma predeterminada support "
"para proxy connectivity. Proxy autenticación support es también "
"proporcionado con ambos Basic Autenticación capabilities así como NTLM para "
"Windows Proxy entornos. |morpheus| es incluso able a configure virtual "
"machines it aprovisiona a utilize estos proxies por setting up el sistemas "
"operativos proxy configuraciones directamente (restricted a cloud-init based"
" Linux platforms para ahora, pero también puede ser done en windows based "
"platforms en un diferente manner)."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:10
msgid ""
"To get started with Proxies, it may first be important to configure the "
"|morpheus| appliance itself to have access to proxy communication for "
"downloading service catalog images. To configure this, visit the |AdmSet| "
"page where a section labeled \"Proxy Settings\" is located. Fill in the "
"relevant connection info needed to utilize the proxy. It may also be advised"
" to ensure that the Linux environment's `http_proxy`, `https_proxy`, and "
"`no_proxy` are set appropriately."
msgstr ""
"A obtener iniciado con Proxies, it puede primero be importante a configure "
"el |morpheus| appliance itself a tienen acceso a proxy communication para "
"downloading servicio catalog imágenes. A configure este, visit el |AdmSet| "
"página donde un sección labeled \"Proxy Configuraciones\" es located. Fill "
"en el relevant conexión info necesario a utilize el proxy. It puede también "
"be advised a asegurar ese el Linux entorno's `http_proxy`, `https_proxy`, y "
"`no_proxy` son establecer appropriately."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:13
msgid "Defining Proxies"
msgstr "Defining Proxies"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:15
msgid ""
"Proxies can be used in a few different contexts and optionally scoped to "
"specific networks with which one may be provisioning into or on a cloud "
"integration as a whole. To configure a Proxy for use by the provisioning "
"engines within |morpheus| we must go to `Infrastructure > Networks > "
"Proxies`. Here we can create records representing connection information for"
" various proxies. This includes the host ip address, proxy port, and any "
"credentials (if necessary) needed to utilize the proxy. Now that these "
"proxies are defined we can use them in various contexts."
msgstr ""
"Proxies se puede usar en un pocos diferente contexts y opcionalmente scoped "
"a específico networks con cual one puede be provisioning en o en un cloud "
"integration como un whole. A configure un Proxy para usar por el "
"provisioning engines dentro de |morpheus| we debe go a `Infraestructura > "
"Redes > Proxies`. Aquí we puede crear records representing conexión "
"información para varios proxies. Este incluye el host ip dirección, proxy "
"puerto, y cualquier credentials (si es necesario) necesario a utilize el "
"proxy. Ahora ese estos proxies son definido we puede usar them en varios "
"contexts."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:18
msgid "Cloud Communication"
msgstr "Cloud Communication"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:20
msgid ""
"When morpheus needs to connect to various cloud APIs to issue provisioning "
"commands or to sync in existing environments, we need to ensure that those "
"api endpoints are accessible by the appliance. In some cases the appliance "
"may be behind a proxy when it comes to public cloud access like Azure and "
"AWS. To configure the cloud integration to utilize a proxy, when adding or "
"editing a cloud there is a setting called \"API Proxy\" under \"Advanced "
"Options\". This is where the proxy of choice can be selected to instruct the"
" Provisioning engine how to communicate with the public cloud. Simply adjust"
" this setting and the cloud should start being able to receive/issue "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Cuando morpheus necesita a connect a varios cloud APIs a problema "
"provisioning commands o a sync en existente entornos, we necesita a asegurar"
" ese esos api endpoints son accessible por el appliance. En algunos cases el"
" appliance puede be behind un proxy cuando it comes a público cloud acceso "
"like Azure y AWS. A configure el cloud integration a utilize un proxy, "
"cuando adding o editing un cloud allí es un setting llamado \"API Proxy\" "
"bajo \"Advanced Opciones\". Este es donde el proxy de choice se puede "
"seleccionar a instruct el Aprovisionamiento engine cómo a communicate con el"
" público cloud. Simply adjust este setting y el cloud debería iniciar being "
"able a recibir/problema instructions."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:23
msgid "Provisioning with Proxies"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento con Proxies"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:25
msgid ""
"Proxy configurations can vary from operating system to operating system and "
"in some cases it is necessary for these to be configured in the blueprint as"
" a prerequisite. In other cases it can also be configured automatically. "
"Mostly with the use of cloud-init (which all of our out of the box service "
"catalog utilizes on all clouds). When editing/creating a cloud there is a "
"setting for \"Provisioning Proxy\" in \"Provisioning Options\". If this "
"proxy is set, |morpheus| will automatically apply these proxy settings to "
"the guest operating system."
msgstr ""
"Proxy configurations puede vary desde sistema operativo a sistema operativo "
"y en algunos cases it es necessary para estos a be configurado en el "
"blueprint como un prerequisite. En otro cases it también puede ser "
"configurado automáticamente. Mostly con el usar de cloud-init (cual todos de"
" nuestro de forma predeterminada servicio catalog utilizes en todos clouds)."
" Cuando editing/creating un cloud allí es un setting para "
"\"Aprovisionamiento Proxy\" en \"Aprovisionamiento Opciones\". Si este proxy"
" es establecer, |morpheus| será automáticamente apply estos proxy "
"configuraciones al guest sistema operativo."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:27
msgid ""
"Overriding proxy settings can also be done on the Network record. Networks "
"(or subnets) can be configured in `Infrastructure > Networks` or on the "
"Networks tab of the relevant Cloud detail page. Here, a proxy can also be "
"assigned as well as additional options like the `No Proxy` rules for proxy "
"exceptions."
msgstr ""
"Overriding proxy configuraciones también puede ser done en el Red record. "
"Redes (o subnets) se puede configurar en `Infraestructura > Redes` o en el "
"Redes pestaña del relevant Nube página de detalles. Aquí, un proxy también "
"puede ser asignado así como adicional opciones like el `No Proxy` reglas "
"para proxy exceptions."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:30
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:32
msgid ""
"When provisioning Docker based hosts within a Proxy environment it is up to "
"the user to configure the docker host proxy configuration manually. There "
"are workflows that can be configured via the Automation engine to make this "
"automatic when creating docker based hosts. Please see documentation on "
"Docker and proxies for specific information."
msgstr ""
"Cuando provisioning Docker based hosts dentro de un Proxy entorno it es "
"hasta el usuario a configure el docker host proxy configuración manualmente."
" Hay son workflows ese se puede configurar via el Automation engine a hacer "
"este automático cuando creating docker based hosts. Por favor ver "
"documentación en Docker y proxies para específico información."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/proxies.rst:34
msgid ""
"Proxy setups can vary widely from company to company, and it may be advised "
"to contact support for help configuring morpheus to work in the proxy "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Proxy setups puede vary widely desde company a company, y it puede be "
"advised a contact support para help configuring morpheus a funcionar en el "
"proxy entorno."
